description=Standalone systemless Gboard preload replacement for Xiaomi Mi 9 SE (grus) on AlphaDroid 4.7. Put a compatible armeabi-v7a Gboard APK at /sdcard/Download/gboard.apk before installing. Requires KernelSU/KernelSU-Next and meta-overlayfs.
